				{
					"id": 120170701,
					"content": "Hey, Ippei, what's the matter?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170702,
					"content": "Ah, it's you. I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170703,
					"content": "Huh? Th—The Almighty Shogun!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170704,
					"content": "You must be looking for my master, Kujou Kamaji? I'm very sorry, he's not here at the moment. But if it pleases you, I will gladly deliver a message on your behalf?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170705,
					"content": "It's okay, I'm not here to see him. We just heard you calling out, so we came to see what was going on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170706,
					"content": "Are you looking for your master?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170707
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170707,
					"content": "Yes. Master Kamaji still hasn't returned from the negotiations, and I'm starting to get worried.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170708,
					"content": "In fairness, he does have a habit of taking long walks and coming back late. It's perfectly possible that he just found somewhere he likes and lost track of time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170709,
					"content": "But for some reason, today I'm particularly nervous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170710,
					"content": "Kujou Kamaji... A descendant of the Kujou Clan, I presume.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170711,
					"content": "That's right. Apologies, since the head of the clan is in poor health at the moment, and Master Masahito is rarely home, Master Kamaji is currently serving as representative of the Kujou Clan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170712,
					"content": "I have heard that things are quite tumultuous within the Tenryou Commission at present. Does this have anything to do with Kujou Kamaji?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170713,
					"content": "Forgive us, Almighty Shogun. The Kujou Clan has failed in its duty.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170714,
					"content": "The Kujou Clan's reputation is damaged and its power over the Tenryou Commission is in decline. Plus you, um... ahem, you have yet to issue a verdict on the Commission's future...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170715,
					"content": "So, Master Kamaji decided to enter negotiations with the Takatsukasa Clan with a view of having them take over...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170716,
					"content": "Surely they would be discussing something like that at their headquarters, right? Why are you looking for them here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170717,
					"content": "Actually, they decided to hold this one elsewhere. I'm a little confused as to why, to be honest, but I didn't feel it was my place to question the higher-ups.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170718,
					"content": "The meeting place is in the mountains near the Grand Narukami Shrine. I believe the Takatsukasa Clan have some kind of base there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170719,
					"content": "Takatsukasa... another familiar name. They have been faithfully serving the Kujou Clan all these years?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170720,
					"content": "Yes, yes. That's why Master Kamaji decided to discuss things with them. I understand they must have had a lot of ground to cover, but still, there's no way it should have gone on this long.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170721,
					"content": "I've searched all over the city. If he really hasn't returned yet, then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170722,
						120170723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170722,
					"content": "Maybe they haven't finished.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170724,
					"content": "Yeah, I thought of that possibility too... but someone of my rank can't just go venturing into Takatsukasa Clan territory like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170725,
					"content": "We can go check things out for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170726
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170726,
					"content": "No, no need. I'm probably just overthinking things. Besides, if they're still at it, they'll only blame me for interrupting the negotiations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170727,
					"content": "I'm only a lowly servant, but Master Kamaji and I grew up together... It'd be terrible if anything ever happened to him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170728,
					"content": "I'm not as smart as Master, so I can't really share his burdens. But the last thing I'd want would be for him to come to harm when I could've done something about it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170729,
					"content": "Hmm... what do you think, Almighty Shogun?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170730,
					"content": "Let's go see what's happening.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170731,
					"content": "With me present, they are unlikely to blame you even if we do happen to interrupt the negotiations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170732,
					"content": "Besides, this has only come about because I failed to make a timely decision. This issue started with me, and I shall be the one to finish it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170733,
						120170734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170733,
					"content": "That's commitment, right there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170735
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170735,
					"content": "Thank you so much, Shogun! I'll keep looking around in the meantime, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170736,
					"content": "Let me mark out the location of the base for you. I hope everything goes smoothly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ippei"
				},
				{
					"id": 120170734,
					"content": "Awesome stuff.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170735
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120170723,
					"content": "Maybe something's happened.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120170724
					]
				}
			]
		},
